{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bde4455f98954a4165c6df5e79264f9d389cd582d68be5b4ae5bf17446000a54", "ja": "（今日の可憐の仕事は、ブライダルモデル。\n外での撮影が終わり、ひとまず休憩に入った……）", "zh": "（可怜今天的工作是当婚纱模特儿。\n室外的拍摄已经结束，有了短暂的休息时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e69180ab87871db394bc1a664dd1f23fe09a36610ab8cab3c6d980f4474f086b", "ja": "お疲れさま、可憐。\n花嫁さんになった気分はどうだった？", "zh": "辛苦了，可怜。\n变成新娘子的感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "e91d6641784b38c61d7af680d9ee08098984eab529f35b7add778690f865f129", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！\nて、手とか、ヒザが……ふ、震えてしまって……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我、我的手，还有脚……都、都在发抖……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1003_p", "source_sha256": "aed252da163eba611d77b9744b3f55174fc7344ce3dd493722ed61cf5ae38e65", "ja": "だ、大丈夫か？　撮影中は、\n堂々としているように見えたけど……。", "zh": "你、你还好吗？\n拍摄时，看起来是挺落落大方的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "b242e119c3c562e19fea40a95b144bb55721cb7e04ed5e9a83affce4cdcee459", "ja": "それは、ひ、必死だっただけです……。\n休憩に入ったら、どっと緊張が……！", "zh": "我其实只是很、很拚命投入而已……\n一开始休息，浑身的紧张就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "a4f41576efd684633a146ee9ffe9a7bfb8392c52c62476e1a0756f363c8a09d9", "ja": "や……やっぱり、私にブライダルモデルなんて……\nむ、無理があったんじゃないでしょうか……。", "zh": "果……果然，让我担任婚纱模特儿……\n是、是不是有点太勉强了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0956bd88c4170475febd60c4bc26d0af104f0638c1fb303350232b8eee6d92ac", "ja": "そんな事ないよ。そのドレスは、可憐によく\n似合ってるし……花嫁の雰囲気がよく出てたと思う。", "zh": "没这回事，我觉得这套服装非常适合可怜……\n而你也有确实呈现出新娘的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "0883676aa8404b0747cfc126248bbf23f5a4e908aabb9e3f1f33473067d71825", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nあうぅ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n啊呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1008_p", "source_sha256": "990e45f8ca21506d61ede9061467931eb66c72588f4a2e4e2ace787d93ad12d6", "ja": "確かに結婚式は、特別な晴れ舞台だからな。\n普通のモデルより、緊張するかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "婚礼毕竟是人生重大的舞台，会比普通的\n模特儿工作还来得紧张，我想也是正常的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "c7ee42afdc614052d11d638f8c6977fd07e7a84c77e95c2fcbb7ac7f3ff1b9d9", "ja": "そ、そうなんです……。特別な、晴れ舞台なのに……\n緊張ばっかりしてる私じゃ、ダメな気がして……。", "zh": "就、就是说啊……这么重大的舞台……\n我觉得不能交给只会一直紧张的我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1010_p", "source_sha256": "84246951e5e7d401322500c208dcc9c5198fae83411d8dbd6456d20b1fde28af", "ja": "いや……うん。だからいいのかもしれない。\nだってほとんどの花嫁さんは、普通の女の子だろう？", "zh": "不……我觉得或许就是要这样才好。\n因为几乎所有的新娘，都只是普通的女孩子对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "b281ee88e4e84dd10b1843acc1fdd9024382f174843d459ca783353b7017c8f9", "ja": "え……あっ。\nい、言われてみれば、そうですよね……。", "zh": "咦……啊！\n经、经你这么一说，确实是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1012_p", "source_sha256": "24a2a27c0bf0c684bd2706e53e15b852dd559e84125b8d7185805adc0553d6d9", "ja": "だからきっと、みんな不安で緊張してるよ。", "zh": "所以我想大家一定都会感到不安跟紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "202520d0cfe812b9ede396e113190119f5c2f51f92a9ee9b1e74204fc5ce2a3c", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……今の私と、同じように……。\nううん、きっと、もっと緊張してるはず……。", "zh": "说、说得也是……就跟现在的我一样……\n不，一定比我还更紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "d7c9605af9299f452fa95f4e392db9341a9a7c082608e10b69f9aa016093d91a", "ja": "ウエディングドレス、似合ってるかな。\n式の当日、ちゃんとできるかなって……。", "zh": "心里一直想着婚纱穿起来好不好看、\n结婚当天能不能打点好一切……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a4f0efec78aa93a43bff2472799426caef17422ae9295462445e01c01d3c08ac", "ja": "うん。だから緊張しながらも、胸を張る可憐の姿は、\nきっと花嫁さんを元気づけられるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯，所以我觉得可怜虽然紧张，\n但你有自信的身影一定能带给新娘子力量的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "a96a7745b086850f3b182c6dfd6efeb67199442b3151509502ecff06661fd1fd", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n私、全然、そんなこと……思いつかなくて……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我完全没有……想得这么多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "a806dbb68f4d6cefb8c97ba97f14d099d64ce1df0e14c8f2307036bc90c25ded", "ja": "私……が、がんばれそうな、気がします……！\n私でも……誰かに、勇気をあげられたら……！", "zh": "我觉得……自、自己好像能再继续努力下去了……！\n就算是我……只要能带给别人勇气的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1018_p", "source_sha256": "adb634bf2479c71f2a5a130ae32a853fe63a574d6d3c271eafa378897fb7ddbf", "ja": "ああ！\nそれはきっと、可憐にしか出来ないことだと思う。", "zh": "没错！\n这肯定是只有可怜才做得到的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "e7358cb0ce0ce7ce22abb138a32cb0deabef0ecb0ba54f1700a9f4feaf9674b0", "ja": "は、はい……！　まだすこし、怖いですけど……\nこのあとの撮影も、がんばります……！", "zh": "好、好的……！虽然还有点怕……\n但接下来的拍摄，我也会加油的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0114_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3eb62d285aecb4d06d729b5b131e51bb722d8ed536ce6747e7b276f9914e98be", "ja": "（自然な可憐のウェディングドレス姿……きっと\nたくさんの花嫁さんに、勇気を与えてくれるはずだ！）", "zh": "（可怜穿着婚纱的自然样貌……一定可以\n带给不少新娘子勇气的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
